 /// and the patches (an estimate above review be23f0a3's 12 to 15 for an 8-bit PNG and its compressed copy).
 const decode_bytes_per_pixel: u64 = 16;
 
-/// A picture whose size its header does not say here (not a PNG or a JPEG: Pillow's) counts as a large photo.
-/// shortcut: Pillow opens up to 2 x 89.5 MP of such formats; read their headers too if they come in that large.
